WEBVTT

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.320
She's here!

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:16.290
It's Shangri-La's top
world ranker, Jackall Tojo!

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.710
Look at her aura she's got with her!

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.880
Jackall-<i>san...</i>

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.390
Welcome back, Jackall-<i>san.</i>

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.010
It must have been a long trip.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.140
It's been awhile, Misaki.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.680
I've heard rumors about you overseas.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:40.270
Seems like you're stronger than ever now.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.520
Thank you very much.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:53.910
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.080
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:05.710
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:18.980
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:24.480
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:30.110
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:35.160
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:40.710
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:46.090
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.960
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:55.640
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:58.350
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:01.560
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:06.650
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.480
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:12.570
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:20.080
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:25.420
SHANGRI-LA

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:25.420
BERSERK

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:25.420
Jackall Tojo

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:25.420
Toyoda Misaki

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:25.420
SPECIAL MATCH

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:31.060
Episode 07: The World Champion Comes to Japan!

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:33.180
With the long awaited
teacher versus student match up...

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.930
...are there any
thoughts you'd like to share?

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:41.060
Toyoda has grown to be
the top wrestler of Berserk.

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:44.520
I can't wait to have a chance to fight her.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:51.940
I'd like my teacher to see
firsthand, how strong I've become.

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:58.330
You're in a good mood, Rio-<i>san.</i>

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:03.580
Well, I started because I
wanted to be like Jackall-<i>san.</i>

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.620
What'd you expect?

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:12.460
I like pro wrestling now!

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:16.340
I want to... continue pro wrestling!

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:21.640
What's the matter, Sakura?

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:24.810
Huh? Nothing...

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:28.110
I-I just thought Misaki-<i>san</i> looked amazing...

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.400
...standing alongside the world champion.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:31.480
...standing alongside the world champion.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:37.910
Inoba Seiichi       Toyoda Misaki               Jackall Tojo          Hasegawa Tsutomu

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.030
There's still time
before the special match, but...

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:37.950
...do you have any plans
now that you're back in Japan?

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:41.370
I plan to train as usual.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:45.250
Oh, come to think of it,
there's an event that interests me.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.960
The event where rookies from
each organization come together.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:50.420
The "Rookie All Star Match."

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:54.630
I'll be keeping an eye out...

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:57.880
...for any raw talents in the making.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.970
I-I'm going out on my road work now!

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:02.850
Me too!

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:06.890
Shoot! I wish I could be a rookie again...

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:28.540
How long has it been
since we've met like this?

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:31.210
Kanae... Is your back okay?

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.960
Ah, yes, absolutely!

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:36.630
I'm busy every day as a top reporter!

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:38.680
I see...

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:46.270
I guess us three former
Golden Age Girls are doing our best.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.390
That's great to know.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.480
I'm still far from being my best.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.440
I need to become stronger...

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:54.520
...so that I can express
my thanks to you, Jackall-<i>san.</i>

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:59.030
That's quite something,
coming from Berserk's top wrestler.

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:03.160
You made me what I am now, Jackall-<i>san.</i>

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.250
Losing forty-nine matches isn't the issue!

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.210
The number of losses isn't the point!

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:15.210
There's only one reason why you can't win.

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:18.720
You're too worried about
your past as a former idol.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:22.640
You lack the resolve to win!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.770
I... give up!

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:29.850
Don't you get it?!

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.480
There's no such thing as giving up!

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:40.490
It... It hurts...!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.740
Use every last drop of your strength!

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.170
Rope!

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:06.050
What you just felt right now...

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.430
That's the true nature of pro wrestling.

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:11.230
The true nature of pro wrestling...

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.940
Endure the disadvantages,
then turn the tables in the end!

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:19.110
A win like that is
what moves the audience!

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:23.320
It's not like I taught you anything special.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:27.330
You're here now
because of your own talent.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:31.620
Sometimes you need
to be told to see things.

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:33.330
Without that experience...

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:37.170
...I wouldn't have liked
wrestling as much as I do now.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:41.590
Oh, I get it! That's why
you did the same with Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:45.260
Right. She was just like me...

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:48.930
Sakura? You mean Hagiwara Sakura?

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:51.390
Do you know her, Jackall-<i>san</i>?

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:56.400
She's the rookie who beat
Rio after her sixty-fifth loss, right?

00:06:56.600 --> 00:07:00.360
You sure know a lot
about what's going on in Japan.

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:06.490
I see. So you see potential in her then.

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:09.740
She does have a lot of potential as a rookie.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:11.700
But...

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.250
But?

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:17.290
She's still young,
with a lot of issues to clear.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.880
In particular, to her emotional side...

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:28.470
The end of year Japan Record Grand Prix...

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.180
...grand prize winner is...

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:38.440
Sweet Diva!

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.070
With the overwhelming
support from the fans...

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:44.320
...Sweet Diva has taken the top!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.780
Congratulations!

00:07:47.990 --> 00:07:49.990
Thank you!

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:53.200
Thank you so very much!

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:04.170
Well, I'm sure Sakura
thought about this well enough.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.420
If she wants to continue wrestling...

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:10.050
...let's let her do what she wants for now.

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:11.890
I guess so...

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:17.270
It must be great to find
something you can really get into.

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:20.360
Sakura is always all in
with anything she does anyways.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:24.070
Yup! I want to support Sakura-<i>chan</i> too!

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.200
Elena!

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:40.960
We'll just have to let those two work it out.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:59.890
We were supposed to
have been here with Sakura...

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.940
Direct hit! Toyoda's high kick!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:11.950
DYNAMITE!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:11.950
Single Match

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:11.950
Toyoda Misaki

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:11.950
Excavator

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:05.150
Direct hit! Toyoda's high kick!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:11.450
The League of Evil's flamboyant
rising star, Excavator Sakuya...

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:14.950
...is taking the blow of justice!

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:18.870
Now's your chance, Misaki-<i>san</i>!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.130
Give up, Sakuya?

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:26.250
Hagiwara Sakura...

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:33.260
I see. So you see potential in her then.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:35.310
It's not only Sakura.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:39.850
Berserk has a lot of
other talents on the rise.

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:41.900
But...

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:52.320
...everyone's still not ready.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:52.990
You okay?

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:56.910
I still need to lead
everyone as the ace here.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:00.250
Toyoda is calmly looking down
at the Excavator outside the ring!

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:02.040
She's going to make her move!

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:05.710
All for the future of girls' pro wrestling!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.260
Misaki-<i>san</i>!

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:18.140
Toyoda?

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:19.770
Toyoda?!

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:21.560
Hey, Toyoda?!

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:30.690
Misaki-<i>san</i>!

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:43.130
Misaki!

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:44.510
Jackall-<i>san...</i>

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:47.260
How bad is it?

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:50.220
I broke my ankle...

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:53.890
They told me to keep
it secure for a few weeks.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:56.900
How's the pain?

00:10:57.100 --> 00:11:00.110
The pain killer is working now, but...

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:03.490
I'm sorry, Jackall-<i>san.</i>

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:06.110
I...

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:13.160
There's no need to apologize.

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:17.210
Getting hurt is just
a part of being a wrestler.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.040
Focus yourself on getting better now.

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:22.800
There'll be other opportunities.

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:25.010
Thank you very much.

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:29.680
Honestly though, this isn't good.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:33.220
We already sold all
thirty-five thousand tickets.

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:38.480
If we cancel the match now,
we'll go broke with the refunds.

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:44.030
I guess we'll have to find a replacement.

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:51.200
But, we don't have any
wrestlers that match your caliber.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.580
I'll make that call myself.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:59.540
We have a well timed
event coming up shortly, right?

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:02.550
You talking about
the Rookie All Star Match?

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:07.430
Why look for someone from the rookies?

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:10.260
There's got to be plenty of
other wrestlers that'll suit you well.

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:11.430
No...

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:15.810
Girls' pro wrestling in
Japan is definitely on the rise.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:17.640
I can see that.

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:22.440
But unfortunately, I couldn't
spot anyone with the talent

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:26.400
among the experienced
wrestlers to face me.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.860
That's a sad story to hear.

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:31.490
Still...

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:42.130
The year opener,
girls' pro wrestling big event...

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:48.380
..the Rookie All Star Match
will open with Sweet Diva's song!

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:13.200
Boss, that was a pretty
harsh opener you set up there.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.200
I can't help it.

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:18.040
This set up was made a year ago...

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:21.920
...and there's a lot
here just to see Sweet Diva.

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:25.790
Say, isn't Sakura-<i>chan</i>
going to be in this event?

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.960
How about we go and cheer her on?

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:30.720
Sounds great, let's go!

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:36.350
We have to hurry out to the ringside.

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:39.020
The first match is already underway.

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:49.030
There it is! YOSHIKO's lariat!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.990
Komiyama's grounded in pain!

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:59.540
Calmly looking on the
heated match is Jackall Tojo!

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.040
With the injuries to Toyoda...

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:06.460
...is she trying to find an
opponent from these hopefuls?!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:10.090
How's this?!

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:11.920
Screw that!

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:15.390
Dumb broad!

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:24.520
- Here I go!
- Oh no!

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:26.230
YOSHIKO's on the rope now!

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:27.770
Here comes YOSHIKO's special move!

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:31.070
YOSHIKO from the Top!

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:33.110
One...!

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:34.530
Two...!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:35.450
Three!

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.070
Hell yeah!

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:41.450
Hey! Jackall Tojo!

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:45.540
I'm the only who can take ya on!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:48.210
Keep that in mind, you hear.

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:55.090
YOSHIKO raised her voice as
a candidate to take on Jackall!

00:14:55.300 --> 00:15:00.430
Now, with us from their opening
are the members of Sweet Diva.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:03.890
We're looking forward
to your comments today.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.310
Thanks for inviting us.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:06.730
Pleased to be here.

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.480
- Hi there!
- Hi there!

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:15.900
Here comes the music that we all know.

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:21.040
Making her appearance is our
wrestling idol, Hagiwara Sakura!

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:30.090
Hagiwara's announcement
to continue wrestling...

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:32.500
...is still fresh in our minds, but...

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:36.840
...I'd like to get your
thoughts on it, Elena-<i>san.</i>

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:38.590
Well...

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:41.600
...it's a choice that
Sakura made from her heart...

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:43.930
...so I'd like to cheer her on.

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:50.650
I was surprised and
shocked at first too, but...

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:56.490
...now that she's here,
I'm hoping she gets stronger!

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:57.570
I see.

00:15:57.780 --> 00:16:01.450
Being apart doesn't
change the bond you have with her.

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:03.080
Yes!

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:10.830
Whoa! Girls' pro
wrestling's number one beauty...

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:15.710
Fujino Subaru... got her
figure four leg lock on firmly!

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.880
C'mon, squeeze!

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:20.300
Get moving!

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:27.230
Okay! Rope break!

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:40.950
It's the Sakura Special!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.870
Fujino can't stand!
She's down for the count!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.080
One...!

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:48.790
Two...!

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.420
Three!

00:16:56.550 --> 00:16:58.760
Now it's the match
you've all been waiting for!

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:00.720
Today's main event!

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.050
Berserk's Suzumoto Chinatsu versus...

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:07.180
...the uprising organization,
Miyabi's ace, Minami Sarina...

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:15.650
It isn't Minami Sarina!

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:19.110
An unknown masked wrestler has appeared!

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.700
What's going on?!

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.880
We just received information.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.000
The name of the masked
wrestler is Blue Panther...

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:40.510
She's a wrestler sent in
by Miyabi to break the match!

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:42.220
Break the match...?

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:47.310
The hell is with that attitude?!

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:49.730
The match's ruined!

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:51.690
You're not going to get away with this!

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:52.980
Yeah!

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:54.900
Please calm yourselves!

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:57.860
Once you enter the ring
carrying the name of an organization...

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:00.990
...it becomes our duty as pro
wrestlers to go with all we've got!

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:04.450
And that's why I'll take her on!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:06.280
All right, Suzumoto!

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:08.540
Give her what she deserves!

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:10.370
Okay? Ready... go!

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:30.640
Okay! Rope break!

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.060
Why you...!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:44.200
Give up, Suzumoto?

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:53.250
Her moves are amazingly refined!

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:56.920
To add, Blue Panther was hardly moving!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.590
It's obvious that she's
a highly skilled wrestler!

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.420
Damn it!

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:06.180
Chinatsu-<i>san</i>! Watch out!

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:17.860
Suzumoto?

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:20.570
Give up, Suzumoto?

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:22.650
Suzumoto! Give up?

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:34.330
What an outcome! Suzumoto gives up!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.790
An instant! It ended in a mere instant!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.750
What an unexpected turn
of events in the main event!

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:42.960
Berserk's number one rising
wrestler, Suzumoto Chinatsu...

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:46.260
...was toyed and put to an end!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:51.220
It... hurts...!

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:54.310
Chinatsu-<i>san</i>!

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:04.820
This was an event to show
the results of our hard work.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:08.320
And you just barged in...

00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:11.830
I won't let you get away with this!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:17.830
A striking debut for Blue Panther!

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:22.960
The wrestler sent in by
Miyabi is shrouded in mystery...

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:24.760
There is only one thing I can say...

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:27.590
A tremendous wrestler
has appeared before us!

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:32.180
Girls' pro wrestling is as
exciting now as it ever will be!

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:55.950
What in the world is Miyabi thinking?!

00:20:58.120 --> 00:20:59.160
Jackall?

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:03.090
Mr. President, I've decided on
my opponent for the special match.

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:04.710
What?!

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:08.420
Wh-Who?

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:14.810
Hagiwara Sakura. I choose you.

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:17.100
Oh, um, yes.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.810
W-What...?!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.720
Jackall Tojo Chooses
Hagiwara Sakura!!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.720
Jackall names the
replacement for the
injured Toyoda Masaki!!

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.220
World
Champion

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.220
Jackal
Tojo

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.220
National
Star Idol

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.220
Hagiwara
Sakura

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.720
Extra Edition

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.720
World Champion

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.720
Jackall Tojo

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.720
National Star Idol

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.720
Hagiwara Sakura

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.720
Finally
Decided

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:38.410
Now then, let the fun show begin!

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:42.120
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:44.880
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:49.630
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:52.510
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:57.010 --> 00:22:02.190
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:22:02.390 --> 00:22:07.820
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:22:08.030 --> 00:22:13.280
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:17.330
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:22:17.530 --> 00:22:18.450
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:21.120
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:23.790
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:31.170
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:22:31.380 --> 00:22:37.300
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:38.510
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:22:38.720 --> 00:22:40.140
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:48.230
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:48.440 --> 00:22:49.860
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:50.070 --> 00:22:53.820
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:54.030 --> 00:22:55.070
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:55.280 --> 00:22:56.620
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:56.820 --> 00:22:59.120
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:22:59.330 --> 00:23:00.580
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:23:00.790 --> 00:23:04.160
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:23:04.370 --> 00:23:07.000
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:33.720
Episode 08: World Class Wrestling!

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:10.670
Chief!

00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:13.170
We've got a historic event in the making!

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:15.130
The dream match between the world champ...

00:23:15.340 --> 00:23:17.510
...and the idol wrestler came true!

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:20.760
Jackall Tojo versus Hagiwara Sakura!

00:23:20.970 --> 00:23:22.180
Through this world class match

00:23:22.390 --> 00:23:24.850
what kind of fight will Sakura-<i>chan</i> show us?

00:23:25.060 --> 00:23:28.520
Wait, what if she wins?!

00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:33.440
Chief! Get ready for a full
page on Sakura-<i>chan</i> tomorrow!

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:38.730
A request from Sakura:

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:38.730
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
